  "caveats": [
    "Centered input rejected before training by unchanged originaleps.003FD gate:5.507%>5%. Separate epsilon diagnostic does not readmit it.",
    "Projection is a numerical null control for the curl-head network. H1 modifies backward direction intentionally; it is not a more accurate derivative of the unchanged objective.",
    "First-update timings include compilation; fixed pilot may use persistent cache. Budget followup disables JAX persistent cache before import; common native/reference/gate preparation remains separate.",
